// Machine blocks and the parts they work (content: base/blocks_machines.ron). Placeholders
// for the pack to redraw: the iron and electric machines share a riveted iron casing; the
// Bronze age machines are wood bound in bronze. Item sprites are drawn once in the metal
// palette's three shades (`a`-`c`) and recoloured per metal. Tiered faces draw their
// tier's colour from the `tier` slot (`A`, `C`, `E`) and a transformer its higher tier's
// from `high` (`P`, `J`).
